air destroyed the pressure of the woods only gets worse. Ghouls, Leshies, Werewolves, and Night Hags are only some of the creatures that will try to destroy your settlement. You'll have to defend your land against monsters and defeat their Baron so that you are able to move to new lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011590/extras/3bd59bda2c1f9496b54f2713dc2f6de6.poster.avif?t=1753781816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011590/extras/3bd59bda2c1f9496b54f2713dc2f6de6.webm?t=1753781816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011590/extras/d36f6fd191223beaa2907eb4fb9abcf9.webp?t=1753781816\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The future of your settlement depends on your progress. You will need to collect Spirit Energy, Darkness Shards, technology and defense points and use them to research new technologies and advance your manufacturing methods to master farming, build new structures, and increase their level and efficiency. Moreover, you'll be able to unlock new spells, magic boosters, new warrior subclasses, advanced armor, and weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011590/extras/0ba8e0303cb13f38374765fd5061d5eb.poster.avif?t=1753781816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011590/extras/0ba8e0303cb13f38374765fd5061d5eb.webm?t=1753781816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cl